{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"22877","name":"Poseidon Athens Hotel","description":"Athens Poseidon Hotel provides the ultimate destination for holidays in the Greek capital. Away from the hustle and bustle of the city center and with incomparable connectivity to all the major sights and attractions in Athens, our hotel boasts a privileged location and can serve the needs of families, couples and parties of friends, adventurers and business people from all over the world. Even on a tight schedule, you may explore Athens to the fullest with the help of the specific location of Athens Poseidon Hotel and thanks to the superb access to all means of transportation. Just a breath away, there is the Tram and a bus station for you to hop on and start discovering the hidden gems of Athens. Greek hospitality is praised in Athens Poseidon Hotel, with fully personalized services that are tailor made to meet your needs and desires. Our team of professionals will make the most out of your stay, providing suggestions as to the places you ought to visit and the things you should do, always serving you with a smile. Our facilities and services will allow you to relax and enjoy every moment of your stay at our hotel. The modern décor of our interior, the wonderful bar and restaurants on offer, the great value for money and the attention to the slightest detail will delight you and introduce you to the true meaning of holidays in Athens. Be it summer or winter, spring or autumn, Athens Poseidon Hotel provides great accommodation while visiting Athens and wishing to take advantage of every last second of your journey here!","address":"Leoforos Posidonos, 72","city":"Paleo Faliro","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"17562","lat":37.9185972,"lng":23.7005022,"stars":3,"giataCode":"31731","phone":"+302109872000","email":"info@poseidonhotel.com.gr","website":"www.poseidonhotel.com.gr","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/02/022877/022877a_hb_a_004.JPG","categ